<title>UK: Lehman leads five-tranche dollar FRN for SASCO.</title>
<headline>Lehman leads five-tranche dollar FRN for SASCO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by sole lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SASCO SERIES 1996/C1</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT   $312,316,213   SPREAD     +25 BP    EXP MAT     25.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 1M LIBOR  LEG MAT     25.OCT.10</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  99.785    REOFFER    99.785</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS B</p>
<p> AMT    $81,628,101   SPREAD     +40 BP    EXP MAT     25.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 1M LIBOR  LEG MAT     25.OCT.10</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  99.648    REOFFER    99.648</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS C</p>
<p> AMT    $70,980,957   SPREAD     +60 BP    EXP MAT     25.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 1M LIBOR  LEG MAT     25.OCT.10</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  99.389    REOFFER    99.389</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS D</p>
<p> AMT    $46,137,622   SPREAD     +100 BP   EXP MAT     25.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 1M LIBOR  LEG MAT     25.OCT.10</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  99.484    REOFFER    99.484</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS E</p>
<p> AMT    21,294,287    SPREAD     +125 BP   EXP MAT     25.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 1M LIBOR  LEGAL MAT   25.OCT.10</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  99.20     REOFFER    99.20</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100 AND MULTIPLES OF ONE (K)</p>
<p> PAY DATE   07.OCT.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
